            <ArticleTitle>Gold(I)-Catalyzed Direct Stereoselective Synthesis of Deoxyglycosides from Glycals.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>14041-14044</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/jacs.7b08898</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Au(I) in combination with AgOTf enables the unprecedented direct and α-stereoselective catalytic synthesis of deoxyglycosides from glycals. Mechanistic investigations suggest that the reaction proceeds via Au(I)-catalyzed hydrofunctionalization of the enol ether glycoside. The room temperature reaction is high yielding and amenable to a wide range of glycal donors and OH nucleophiles.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
